{"t":"Vengoth/Werewolf Cave","s":"vengoth-werewolf-cave-1d59f","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Werewolf_11b9a7.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Vengoth Werewolf Cave</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Werewolf\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werewolf_11b9a7.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a> mountain. The access ramp is <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32980,31497,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32980, 31497, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">80</span> and 75 / 75 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">80</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">90</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Relic Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Relic_Sword_7fa049.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Dreaded Cleaver\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dreaded_Cleaver_202104.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bonebreaker\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bonebreaker_c90df9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Epee\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Epee_2ea7fa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Trophy\"><img alt=\"Wolf Trophy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wolf_Trophy_8a9152.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.20<br/>September 27, 2011<br/>Autumn Patch 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThere are about 15 <a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf\">Werewolves</a> living in this cave. For mid-level players, the cave presents a good xp/h, since the xp/hp ratio of Werewolves is above average. For high-level characters, however, the xp/h is not as good, since there are relatively few Werewolves there. This cave provides one of the fastest ways to accomplish the Werewolf killing <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">task</a>.\n</p><p>Werewolves drop many valuable items fairly often that can make hunting these creatures very profitable with a little luck. Although if no rares drop it will be a big waste.\n</p><p>A simple strategy for shooters is to shoot <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">fire bomb runes</a> in the cave intersections, lure the Werewolves one by one and position themselves in the middle of the fields. The Werewolf will step into the fields once it is under attack, but the other creatures, including its summons, will stay away.\n</p><p>For <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">knights</a> just try to lure the Werewolf to one of the many narrow parts of the cave so that only the Werewolf and one summon can attack you. You can use <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Field\">fire field</a> to help accomplish this.\nA level 90+ <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">knight</a> with skills of 85 or higher can kill around 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf\">werewolf</a> with 500 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a> and around 40 <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potions</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\"><img alt=\"War Wolf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/War_Wolf_6ce311.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolf</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">55</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">140</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">50 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Warwolf Fur (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Paw\">Wolf Paw</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Trophy\">Wolf Trophy</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf\"><img alt=\"Werewolf\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werewolf_11b9a7.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf\">Werewolf</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,955</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">515+ (without summons), 615+ (with summons)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-225× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Werewolf Fur (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf%20Fangs\">Werewolf Fangs</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Plate Shield (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rusted%20Armor\">Rusted Armor</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Mushroom\">Brown Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Moonlight Crystals (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Green\">Troll Green</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Paw\">Wolf Paw</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Halberd\">Halberd</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk%20Potion\">Berserk Potion</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Amulet\">Platinum Amulet</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Time%20Ring\">Time Ring</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Epee (rare)</li>\n<li>Relic Sword (very rare)</li>\n<li>Bonebreaker (very rare)</li>\n<li>Dreaded Cleaver (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest"]}